SIRCompilerModuleRegistry
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Module registry of the self-hosting SIR compiler (Track C, native Include). Each module is a modules/<Name>/ folder with <Name>.sir code and doc.stf documentation. Every file must be registered here by its POSIX path.

